    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) and the Department of Health (DoH), Government of Sindh, have signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) to strengthen services at the District Headquarters Hospital (DHQ), Tando Allah Yar. Supported by the Aga Khan Maternal and Child Care Centre (AKMCCC), Hyderabad, this collaboration aims to enhance the quality and safety of healthcare delivery under the ongoing Essential Package of Health Services (EPHS) Tando Allah Yar Project.",
